{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六宗者。花巖。法相。三論。成實。俱舍。今一宗不載之而是律宗歟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云不同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【考】立恐之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
